[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3627990070","pull_request_review_id":4751631397,"id":3627990070,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7YPrw2","diff_hunk":"@@ -477,6 +477,7 @@ Error XMLParser::open_buffer(const Vector<uint8_t> &p_buffer) {\n Error XMLParser::_open_buffer(const uint8_t *p_buffer, size_t p_size) {\n \tERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_size == 0, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n \tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(p_buffer, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n+\tDEV_ASSERT(p_buffer[p_size] == 0);","path":"core/io/xml_parser.cpp","commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","original_commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Things like this that can happen at runtime should be `ERR_FAIL` not `DEV_ASSERT`.\n\nRead the section on `DEV_ASSERT` in `error_macros.h`, copy pasted here:\n```\n/**\n * Note: IN MOST CASES YOU SHOULD NOT USE THIS MACRO.\n * Do not use unless you understand the trade-offs.\n *\n * DEV macros will be compiled out in releases, they are wrapped in DEV_ENABLED.\n *\n * Prefer WARNINGS / ERR_FAIL macros (which fail without crashing) - ERR_FAIL should be used in most cases.\n * Then CRASH_NOW_MSG macros (on rare occasions where error cannot be recovered).\n *\n * DEV_ASSERT should generally only be used when both of the following conditions are met:\n * 1) Bottleneck code where a check in release would be too expensive.\n * 2) Situations where the check would fail obviously and straight away during the maintenance of the code\n *    (i.e. strict conditions that should be true no matter what)\n *    and that can't fail for other contributors once the code is finished and merged.\n */\n```\n\nThis fails on not being a bottleneck, and also likely on being something that can occur at runtime, given your description.","created_at":"2026-07-22T06:32:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T06:32:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3627990070","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3627990070"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3627990070"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3627990070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":480,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628034634","pull_request_review_id":4751683711,"id":3628034634,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7YP2pK","diff_hunk":"@@ -477,6 +477,7 @@ Error XMLParser::open_buffer(const Vector<uint8_t> &p_buffer) {\n Error XMLParser::_open_buffer(const uint8_t *p_buffer, size_t p_size) {\n \tERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_size == 0, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n \tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(p_buffer, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n+\tDEV_ASSERT(p_buffer[p_size] == 0);","path":"core/io/xml_parser.cpp","commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","original_commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","user":{"login":"Karticoder","id":168813500,"node_id":"U_kgDOCg_jvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168813500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder","html_url":"https://github.com/Karticoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"You're completely right. Since `_open_buffer` is called at runtime (including via GDExtension), relying on `DEV_ASSERT` is unsafe because it's compiled out in release builds, leaving the engine vulnerable to out-of-bounds reads if a non-null-terminated buffer is provided.\r\n\r\nI have updated the patch to replace the `DEV_ASSERT` check with `ERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_buffer[p_size] != 0, ERR_INVALID_DATA);` and added a unit test to verify this behavior.\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T06:39:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T06:39:26Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3628034634","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628034634"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3628034634"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628034634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":480,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3627990070,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628426513","pull_request_review_id":4752153151,"id":3628426513,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7YRWUR","diff_hunk":"@@ -477,6 +477,7 @@ Error XMLParser::open_buffer(const Vector<uint8_t> &p_buffer) {\n Error XMLParser::_open_buffer(const uint8_t *p_buffer, size_t p_size) {\n \tERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_size == 0, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n \tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(p_buffer, ERR_INVALID_DATA);\n+\tDEV_ASSERT(p_buffer[p_size] == 0);","path":"core/io/xml_parser.cpp","commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","original_commit_id":"0c4dda7389203a14c87f510ffe861d22a2325cc8","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"@Karticoder: Are you using AI for any part of this PR? Your reply above sounds suspiciously like AI","created_at":"2026-07-22T07:46:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T07:46:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3628426513","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628426513"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121624#discussion_r3628426513"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121624"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3628426513/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":480,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3627990070,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]